  - exact ZW.
  - exact CRED.
  - intros fx' R' M' model' LK' Aw' cr' k' RP ZK SKA' HP CK MRT ILK IAW AM' HH'.
    exact (KONT fx' R' M' model' LK' Aw' k' cr' RP SKA' ZK HP CK MRT ILK IAW AM' HH').
Qed.

